<note><title>Grandma&apos;s cardamom buns</title><content>
<![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div><b>Makes 24 buns.</b> Start the dough the <i>night before</i>.</div><div><br/></div><h2>Dough</h2><ul><li><div>500 g flour</div></li><li><div>2 tsp <span style="font-weight: bold;">freshly ground</span> cardamom</div></li><ul><li><div>green pods, not black</div></li><li><div>crush with a mortar</div></li></ul><li><div>75 g butter</div></li></ul><div><br/></div><div><en-media hash="4c048024771edb5751c98035a4b80a2a" type="image/png" width="480"/></div><h3>Steps</h3><ol><li>Warm the milk to 37&#176;C.</li><li>Knead for <u>ten minutes</u>.<ol><li>Rest an hour.</li></ol></li><li>Bake at 225 &deg;C &ndash; about 8 min.</li></ol></en-note>]]>
</content><created>20190314T081500Z</created><updated>20240102T193000Z</updated><tag>baking</tag><tag>family recipes</tag><note-attributes><author>Sara Lind</author></note-attributes><resource><data encoding="base64">
iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAQAAAADCAIAAAA7ljmRAAAAEElEQVR4nGO41GMDRww4OQB+AhM5
emg4oAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==
</data><mime>image/png</mime><width>4</width><height>3</height><recognition><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><recoIndex docType="picture"><item x="1" y="1" w="2" h="2"><t w="31">bun</t></item></recoIndex>]]></recognition></resource></note>
