<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div><en-todo checked="true"/>Oat milk</div><div><en-todo checked="false"/>Lemons</div><div><en-todo/>Saffron <i>(the good one)</i></div><div><br/></div><div>Evernote 10 list:</div><ul style="--en-todo:true;"><li style="--en-checked:true;"><div>Coffee</div></li><li style="--en-checked:false;"><div>Bread</div></li></ul></en-note>]]>
</content><created>20240901T070000Z</created><updated>20240905T120000Z</updated><tag>home</tag><note-attributes><author>Sara Lind</author></note-attributes></note>
<note><title>Pasta night for eight</title><content>
<![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Pasta night for eight</div><div>Guests: Åsa, Jürgen, 李雷, محمد and Zoë 🍝&nbsp;&nbsp;(two vegetarians)</div><table style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tbody><tr><td><b>Dish</b></td><td><b>Who</b></td><td><b>Cost</b></td></tr><tr><td>Cacio e pepe</td><td>Jonas</td><td>120 kr</td></tr><tr><td>Salad | greens</td><td>Emma</td><td>45 kr</td></tr></tbody></table><div>Recipe from <a href="https://example.com/cacio-e-pepe">this blog</a> and https://example.com/raw.</div><hr/><div style="box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; -en-codeblock: true;"><div>water = 4 L</div><div>salt = 40 g  # 10 g per litre</div></div><blockquote><div>Pasta water is the sauce.</div></blockquote><div>Snake_case and 2 * 3 stay as typed.</div></en-note>]]>
</content><created>20250620T170000Z</created><updated>20250621T090000Z</updated><note-attributes><author>Sara Lind</author></note-attributes></note>
